docs {
  # Create Trip Day

  Creates a new day in the trip itinerary.

  ## Requirements
  - Must be trip owner
  - Date must be unique for the trip
  - Trip must exist

  ## Fields
  - `trip_id`: ID of the parent trip
  - `date`: Calendar date (YYYY-MM-DD format)
  - `day_number`: Sequential day number (1, 2, 3...)
  - `day_type`: Type of day (transit, sightseeing, leisure, etc.)
  - `title`: Optional title for the day
  - `place`, `place_city`, `place_country`: Location details
  - `timezone`: Timezone for the location
  - `activities`: Array of planned activities (name, time, duration, cost, etc.)
  - `bookings`: Array of bookings (restaurant, tour, show, etc.)
  - `accommodation_*`: Hotel/lodging details
  - `notes`: Free-form notes

  ## Auto-updates
  Creating a trip day will automatically update the parent trip's:
  - `countries_visited`
  - `cities_visited`
}
